gh  beforehand that would have set  parameters of what the raiders were  looking for and then just no one bit or  did they have no conversations  whatsoever at any time with anyone about  moving out of that number four spot  i don't know the answer to that mike  knowing mayok i bet he did have  conversations but  because he's just the ultimate boy scout  he's always going to be prepared but i  can't answer the question the point is  though in that 8 or 10 minute period  they didn't get a single phone call and  that to me  tells you what the market is  uh at that point in the draft and nobody  is so hot for somebody now if quinn and  williams had been there let's say the  jets had taken josh allen at three  and quinn and williams had been there  i'll bet you a lot of money they would  have gotten calls for the fourth pick  then  peter how do you look at you know just  what was your outside look you're just  evaluating mayok and gruden altogether i  mean you know what was your overall  synopsis just about the relationship the  working relationship and how it's all  working  that uh that john gruden really really  needs  mike mayok right you know he was in what  i would call an arranged marriage with  reggie mckenzie you know and he thought  reggie mackenzie was okay but it wasn't  his guy  and so this was totally different chris  this is a guy who i'm just going to read  you one quote from from my column  i've known mike since i was offensive  coordinator at philadelphia in 95. i  work there i see mike i get the head  coaching job in oakland i see mike i go  to tampa i see mike i start broadcasting  i see mike i really got to know mike and  his preparation is no bs  that is what john gruden likes  he likes a sick  football  nerd  that's what mike mayok is right  everybody knows it he is on february  15th he's gonna be up till three o'clock  in the morning looking at the fifth  round corners that's what he does  that's what he loves  john gruden needs that kind of guy 